WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.550
<b>A Village Out in the Boonies: Hage</b>

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.400
Here we go again...

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.040
There, there...

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.390
There you are.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.740
Those two finally calmed down.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.370
Are they brothers... or perhaps twins?

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.190
No, they're not.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.520
This one is rather calm, but this one...

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.170
seems like he has a lot of spunk.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.090
First of all, they don't look a thing alike.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.210
Hm? "Yuno"...

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:05.390
Let's see. And the spunky one over here is—

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.590
Hey! You're a bit too spunky...

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.290
"Asta," eh?

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:23.010
Right! You two don't need to 
worry about a thing anymore.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:26.160
Starting today, this is your new home...

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.450
Asta, Yuno.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.150
<b>15 Years Later</b>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:45.720
Hopefully, we'll have a 
great harvest this year.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.850
Yeah.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:48.920
Hup.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.950
Sister Lily!

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.220
What the...

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.320
Must be that runt from the church again.

00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:01.200
I'll become the Wizard King 
someday and make you happy!

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.160
So please marry me!

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:09.600
I'm sorry, Asta, but I'm everyone's sister.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.240
Not yet!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.040
Um... I'm sorry.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.400
I'm not giving up yet!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.380
Er, um... But...

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.590
I'm not giving up!

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.530
I'm really sorry!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.640
One more time, Sister Lily!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.940
Stop pestering me!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:35.360
Water Creation Magic: Holy Fist of Love!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.150
I-I'm sorry, Asta.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.160
I used magic from my 
grimoire without thinking...

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.050
Well done, sister.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.700
No mercy whatsoever.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.160
I-I... It just happened..

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.000
I'm not done yet!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.400
Sheesh.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:04.220
How many times does she have to dump you?

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:08.320
Why are you getting in my way too, Yuno?!

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:10.730
Why?

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.340
Because you're loud, short,

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:19.230
<b>Loud</b>

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:19.230
<b>Short</b>

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.250
obnoxious, and immature.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:19.230
<b>Obnoxious</b>

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.230
<b>Immature</b>

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.230
Basically, you're not appealing
to women in any way.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.500
<b>Not appealing</b>

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.320
Hey! Is that what you say to 
someone you've grown up with

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.390
for the past fifteen years,
you handsome jerk?!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.560
Let me give you a hand.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.480
Thanks.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.970
Don't ignore me, damn it!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.990
Asta, Sister Lily is a woman of the cloth,
so she can't get married.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:39.400
Also, you're only fifteen,
so you can't get married anyway.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:45.010
Shut up! Yuno, you jerk... I oughta...

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:47.010
I challenge you to a fight, Yuno!

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.070
And I decline.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:49.810
Why the hell not?!

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.200
Because it's a waste of time.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.410
What'd you say?!

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:58.820
Give it a rest, Asta.
There's no way you can beat Yuno.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:00.320
Take this...

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.200
My ultimate...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.320
Hold up, Asta.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.150
Attack!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.150
I mean, you can't even use magic.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.440
Nothing came out!

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.090
I'm not done yet!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.350
You're funny, Asta!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.460
You have zero sense.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:21.000
It's hard to believe someone
your age can't use magic yet.

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:25.270
The hell's your problem?! How dare 
you speak to your elders that way?!

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:26.520
Shut up.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.640
Magic is everything in this world.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.380
It's only natural to be able to use magic.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.730
You're the only one I've ever 
seen who can't use it, Asta.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.030
G-Guess I don't have a choice...

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.690
I'll have to show you what 
I'm really made of...

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.360
What you're really made of?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.870
How you like that?! I know you 
can't do sit-ups this fast!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.810
What's your point, you idiot?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.000
You're funny, Asta!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.390
Yuno's so cool!

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:05.340
That's Yuno for you.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.120
He's such a great help.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.620
Then leave... the wood-chopping...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.520
to me!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:24.230
I still can't believe you 
two are the same age.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.370
Yuno is the hope of this church!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.200
I won't be surprised if you end up joining

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.250
the Magic Knights who serve
the Wizard King, Yuno!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.820
The awarding ceremony is coming up, Asta.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.680
Once you receive your grimoire,

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.320
it should trigger something within you, 
and you should be able to use magic, too.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.520
Sister...

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.840
At least, I think so.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.070
I'll get my grimoire soon...

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:56.850
Finally... Finally!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:00.320
I'll get a grimoire that's more 
amazing than anyone else's,

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.150
get into the Magic Knights,
follow in your footsteps,

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:06.780
and become the Wizard King!

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:09.070
There he goes again.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:12.570
And I'll fix up this shabby, ugly church!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.050
Well, I'm sorry it's so shabby and ugly!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.160
Right, Yuno?

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.230
Right?

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.840
Just you wait...

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.860
Just you wait, damn it!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.040
Asta, wait!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.720
Is he really older than me?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:56.030
Say, Yuno... Couldn't you 
be a bit nicer to Asta?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:01.210
Like you used to be. Remember how you two 
were always together when you were little?

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.210
<i>Yuno used to be such a crybaby,</i>

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.300
<i>but ever since the day he brought
Asta back with those terrible injuries,</i>

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:11.530
<i>Yuno hasn't cried at all.</i>

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.560
I can't be nicer to him.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:26.160
<i>Come to think of it, Asta has come home
covered in mud ever since that day, too.</i>

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.320
<i>I wonder what he's doing out there...</i>

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:35.680
994... 995, 996,

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:42.930
997, 998, 999... 1,000!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.880
And now for this moguro leaf juice,
which is supposed to be

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:49.090
good for increasing magical powers!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.500
I'm going to become the Wizard King.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.650
That's the one thing I'll never give up on!

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:10.110
But before that, I need to build myself up!

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:20.120
<i>March... When firefly dandelion fluff 
starts to dance through the air.</i>

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:25.810
<i>Once a year, all around the Clover Kingdom, 
all of the 15-year-olds are gathered,</i>

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:28.270
<b>Grimoire Tower</b>

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.520
<i>and an awarding ceremony 
is held, where they receive</i>

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.120
<i>their own grimoires, which 
enhance their magical powers.</i>

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.170
Wow!

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:35.150
A-Are all of these grimoires?

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:37.180
Which one is mine?

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:41.930
<i>Once I get my grimoire, I'm sure 
I'll be able to use magic, too.</i>

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.930
<i>I'll catch up to Yuno in no time!</i>

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:51.300
Hmph. I guess today's the day
I become a full-fledged mage.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.730
Hey, look over there.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:58.740
Pathetic, isn't it? They shouldn't have 
to give grimoires to dregs like that.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.900
You said it.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.530
Don't tell me they're

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:06.120
actually planning on taking the 
Magic Knights' entrance exams, too.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:11.710
Only nobles born with immense magical power
or ties to the royal family ever get in.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:16.000
Besides, I heard that shrimp
can't even use magic!

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.640
Wow... Then we need to take good care of him.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.810
He's like a national treasure,
since he's probably

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.350
the only one in this whole 
kingdom who can't use magic.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.150
Welcome, young men and women.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:34.730
You all begin a new journey today.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:38.900
I wish you all faith, hope, and love.

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.780
I am the master of this grimoire tower.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.370
We've never had a Wizard King from this area,

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:53.040
nor anyone who's actually achieved 
greatness in the Magic Knights.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:58.090
I sincerely hope that one of you 
will become the Wizard King someday.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.550
No, really! Seriously!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.050
Ahem.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.680
Now it's time

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:08.010
for the awarding... of the grimoires!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.870
This is my grimoire?

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.790
Check it out! Mine's bigger!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.720
Mine's thicker, though.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:31.930
All right! Now I can leave 
this town and go to the city.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.830
I'm gonna take over the family business.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.300
<i>This</i> is my grimoire?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.560
Mine's like...

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:45.760
I'll... think about my future more once 
my grimoire has more pages filled in.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.970
We'll be taking the Magic Knights' 
entrance exams in six months.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.690
We'll be sure to get in.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.650
Good, good. I look forward to it.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.700
Um...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.910
My grimoire's not coming.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.710
Um...

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.710
My grimoire's not coming.

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:25.220
Er...

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:26.970
Try again next year.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:30.140
What?!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.380
What the heck?!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.980
That's actually amazing!

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.480
That's way too funny!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.340
Seriously?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.320
I can't believe it.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:44.360
If we competed to see who was most pathetic,
we'd be no match for that guy.

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.950
A four-leaf clover...

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.780
A four-leaf? You mean the legendary...

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.220
H-Hey...

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:07.610
The one that the first Wizard King received?

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:12.640
The grimoire said to be filled 
with immense power and good luck?

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:14.290
Him?

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.070
That peasant?

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:17.440
Wow!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.400
I'm going to become the Wizard King.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:30.130
Awesome!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:34.250
He's the shining star of Hage!

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.120
You're amazing, Yuno!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.460
He's so cool.

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.590
Yuno...

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.560
Just you wait.

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.340
I'll catch up to you in no time.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:51.350
Because I'm your rival!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.840
Did he just say "rival"?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.110
He didn't even get a grimoire. 
What is he thinking?

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.510
Not possible.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:21.010
All right, kids! We're heading 
home to prepare for the feast!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:24.300
You can each have three tatoes today!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.340
Yay!

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:27.680
I sure would like to eat something 
else once in a while.

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:40.080
What an amazing thing to find 
in a crummy little town like this.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.250
I thought that once I got my grimoire,

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:52.210
I'd be able to use magic, but...

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.200
I never thought I wouldn't even get one.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:05.890
But... like hell I'm gonna give up!

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.770
Don't you dare underestimate me, fate!

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:12.640
I'll show you!

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:16.110
Even if it takes one, two, 
ten, or a hundred years!

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:19.310
I'll keep working hard 
until I get my grimoire!

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:23.470
I'll become the Wizard King, and prove 
to everyone that anyone can be awesome,

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:26.650
even if they're poor or just some orphan!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.610
You jerk!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.860
Just you wait, Yuno!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.280
H-Hey, you don't have to go that far.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:38.000
We should've been the stars today.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:42.960
And yet... this peasant receives 
a four-leaf clover?!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.380
I'll just...

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.390
Hey!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.960
I'll just have to turn it into ash!

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:06.530
He held back my flames without 
even using his grimoire?!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:11.530
D-Do something!

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.010
But...

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.010
Do it!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.500
I can't let you go and burn that.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:32.130
Don't bother to resist.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.910
My Creation Magic: Binding Iron Chain

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.680
restricts the magic and movements 
of the one it captures.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.090
Who are you?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:49.190
Until recently, I was a pretty well-known 
Magic Knight called Revchi of Chain Magic.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:54.200
But I got kicked out, so now 
I'm just a wretched thief.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:59.200
And I'll be taking that grimoire.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:06.710
Revchi, was it? It's pointless 
for you to steal that.

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:07.780
The only one—

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:11.290
The only one who can use a 
grimoire is the one it chose.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:15.060
However, underground collectors 
are buying grimoires

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.720
with four-leaf clovers for insane prices.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.470
A four-leaf clover may have chosen you,

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:23.240
but you only just received it.
You're still just a little chick.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:27.720
How unfortunate for you that 
I happened to be here.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:31.230
Your legend is going to end 
before it even begins.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:35.960
Hey, that pendant looks like 
it's worth something, too.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.560
I guess I'll be taking that...

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:43.410
Hold it!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.170
What do you think you're doing?!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:53.920
I've come to save...

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:55.670
Huh?

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.220
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.280
That's Yuno's grimoire!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:05.350
Why do you have it? You thief!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:10.560
Aren't you the pathetic little brat 
who wasn't even given a grimoire?

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.830
Oh, you remember me!

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:15.240
Yeah, I'm that pathetic little brat!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.990
A grimoire is precious to 
the person who received it!

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.550
Give it back to Yuno, you jerk!

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:29.040
The outside world is a place where crooked 
deeds like this can be overlooked.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.870
But you'll be dead before you
find that out for yourself.

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:34.840
Asta, run!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.570
I'm not going to run away

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.390
from a disgraced loser like him!

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.250
I'm not done yet!

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:03.330
No... You're finished.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:09.290
Dance of the Pitless Viper!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.970
<i>Wh-What a heavy blow...</i>

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:24.970
<i>So this is the power of the mages 
from outside this town.</i>

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:29.230
<i>I can't possibly beat him 
with just my physical training.</i>

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.390
Thank you for that useless struggle, brat.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.570
Not yet. I'm not finished...

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.540
I'm going to be... the Wizard King.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.200
You? The Wizard King?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.200
I have the ability to find out

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.870
just how much magical power 
one has with these chains.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:52.080
And you have no magic whatsoever.

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:57.090
You must've been born that way.
No wonder you couldn't get a grimoire.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:59.680
To think that you lack
even an ounce of magic

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.930
in this world where magic is everything.

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.510
What a priceless find!

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.260
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.930
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:16.730
<i>Then no matter how hard I try, 
I won't be able to use magic?</i>

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:20.400
To think that someone so pathetic existed.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:23.770
You won't even be able to find a job, 
let alone become the Wizard King!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:29.670
I'm sure your friend, the great 
genius over there, mocks you, too.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.790
<i>Yeah, maybe.</i>

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.560
<i>Yuno's so amazing that he 
was chosen by the four-leaf.</i>

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.420
<i>I'm just...</i>

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:43.630
You can't do a thing in this world. 
Just give up on everything.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:46.600
You were born a loser!

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:49.310
<i>He's right.</i>

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:54.640
<i>No matter how hard I try, 
some things just can't be helped.</i>

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.400
<i>I'm just going to give...</i>

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.650
Hey!

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.820
Who are you calling a loser?

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:06.490
Asta, it's true that you won't be 
able to become the Wizard King,

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.130
no matter what.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:12.250
You hear that? Even your little friend 
is telling you it's impossible.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.540
That's because I'm going 
to become the Wizard King!

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:19.940
What?

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.710
He's no loser.

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:25.090
He's...

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.010
Asta's my rival!

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:32.110
Huh?

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.950
Him? Your rival?

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:36.350
This brat who has no 
magical power whatsoever?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.310
Not... Not yet.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:47.660
Sorry you had to see me 
looking that pathetic, Yuno.

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:50.280
Just a sec...

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.200
I'm gonna kick this guy's butt!

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.510
A gri... moire?

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:11.850
I knew it.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:16.140
There's no way that Asta 
wouldn't have been chosen!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.930
Your magic?

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:32.240
But you didn't have any magic within you!

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:35.230
What in the world is that grimoire?!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:43.210
<i>The three leaves of the clover
 represent faith, hope, and love.</i>

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:50.640
<i>Within a fourth leaf dwells good luck.</i>

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:55.930
<i>Within a fifth leaf...</i>

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.760
<i>resides a demon.</i>

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:18.620
<b>Asta and Yuno</b>

00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:34.720
<i>Grey words can't make anything happen</i>

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:37.220
<i>I know, yeah I know</i>

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:42.730
<i>Wishing to fly freely across the sky</i>

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:45.020
<i>I dreamed it all my life</i>

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:48.510
<i>Step by step I go, though 
it's a doubtful world </i>

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:50.570
<i>Don't care how much I fall</i>

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Instinct is my guide, I never give up</i>

00:22:55.000 --> 00:23:00.400
<i>To faraway future, I burst out running</i>

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:05.760
<i>Go beyond even the unseen fears</i>

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:10.910
<i>The vision I had, so I can be myself</i>

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Someday I will write the next page</i>

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.690
<i>You are my hope</i>

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:22.270
<i>Like that page from someday</i>

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.950
<i>I was able to meet you</i>

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:28.040
<i>I call this a miracle</i>

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:38.700
I'm not going to give up just 
because I can't use magic!

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:42.950
It doesn't matter if you're a peasant or
an orphan! Anyone can shine in this world!

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:46.650
<i>Black Clover,</i> Page 2: "The Boys' Promise."

00:23:44.140 --> 00:23:51.640
Page 2

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.880
Not giving up is my magic!
